spans.s:
अनु-कम्पक, अस्, m. (sympathizer), N. of a king;
(अस्, आ, अम्), (at the close of compounds) sympathizing
with, compassionating.

अनु-कार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, fit to be imitated or
(dramatically) acted; (अम्), n. subsequent business;
subsequent day (?).

अनूक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, spoken after, recited after;
occurring in the (sacred) text; studied; (अम्), n. =
the next.

अनुगुण अनु-गुण, अस्, आ, अम्, having similar
qualities, congenial with; according or suitable to;
(अम्), ind. naturally; (अस्), m. natural peculiarity.

अनु-ज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, assented to, permitted,
allowed; ordered, directed, instructed; accepted;
authorized, honoured; allowed to depart, dismissed.

अनुपथ अनु-पथ, अस्, आ, अम्, following the
road; having favourable roads ?; (अस्), m. a road;
(अम्), ind. along the road.

अनु-पान, अम्, n. a fluid vehicle in medicine;
drink taken with or after medicine; drink close at
hand.

अनुप्रणुद् अनु-प्र-णुद् (-नुद्), cl. 6. P. A.
-णुदति, -ते, -णोत्तुम्, to push away from one's self;
to frighten away, put to flight.

अनुप्रविश् अनु-प्र-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति,
-वेष्टुम्, to follow in entering, to attack, enter;
to sleep with.

अनु-योगिन्, ई, इनी, इ, what combines or unites;
connected or combined with, situated in or on, ques-
tioning, examining.

अनुव्यध् अनु-व्यध्, cl. 4. P. -विध्यति, -व्यद्-
धुम्, to follow in striking; to hit again and again;
to wound.

अनुव्याहरण अनु-व्याहरण (-वि-आ-हरण),
अम्, n. or अनु-व्याहार, अस्, m. cursing, execration;
repeating, repeated utterance.

अनु-ष्ठु, उस्, f., Ved. proper order, succession;
only used in inst. अनु-ष्ठुया; (उ), ind. in proper
order, in regular succession, properly.

अनु-सारक, अस्, आ, अम्, or अनु-सारिन्, ई, इणी, इ,
following, attendant on, according or conformable to;
penetrating, scrutinizing, investigating.

अनूत्था अनूत्था (अनु-उद्-स्था), cl. 1. P.
अनूत्तिष्ठत्, अनूत्थातुम्, of follow in rising;
Ved. to approach.
